  "source_findings": [
    "Eight BDI candidate features are all present at recorded ordinals in actual original archives and match native sourceIDs/hashes. This is source identity verification, not per-key spatial applicability.",
    "BDI ADM1 is the represented2014 Wikimedia source. Actual original XML records2022-11-14 polyline creation and FeatureToPolygon, followed by attribution/export. No lake/river allocation, raster registration, control points or positional error is documented in the inspected archive. No constructor was executed here.",
    "Actual named province raster was visually inspected: Bujumbura Rural and Rumonge labels/outlines are present; no coordinate grid, scale bar, lake median/thalweg legend or international allocation convention is shown. Exact historical raster-byte binding remains as qualified in sibling research.",
    "BDI ADM2 is represented2007 NYU/Stanford/MapMaker. Original archive already contains119 polygon records and Name/Level attributes; no XML construction log or license screenshot. Do not transfer ADM1 polygonization history to ADM2 or infer a specific line-to-polygon operation from catalogue wording."
  ],
