    "actual_read": "All3pages extracted and independently visually inspected",
    "title": "Loi no1/10 du26mars2015 portant creation de la province de Rumonge et delimitation des provinces de Bujumbura, Bururi et Rumonge",
    "findings": [
      "Article1creates Rumonge province. Article2lists Bugarama,Burambi,Buyengero,Muhuta,Rumonge and preserves their existing delimitations.",
      "Article4lists Bujumbura communes including Kabezi and Mutambu and likewise preserves their existing delimitations. Article6does so for Bururi.",
      "Article9provides entry into force on promulgation; signature date26March2015 visually verified.",
      "No coordinate annex/map or river/lake line specification appears in this3page instrument. It concerns province grouping, not authenticated spatial equality with2007commune vectors."
    ],
    "interpretation_limits": [
      "Rumonge in the represented2014 ADM1 source is a temporal/source-label inconsistency relative to2015legal creation, not automatic grounds to discard the frozen source.",
      "Preserved2015commune delimitations do not prove no changes from2007 to2015 or establish equality with frozen MapMaker polygons.",
      "This law supplies no international lake-edge rule and cannot clear either native key."
    ],
